ON THE xAPI SPECIFICATION

The statement shapes and property names this library emits follow the Experience
API (xAPI) specification, published by the Advanced Distributed Learning
Initiative at https://github.com/adlnet/xAPI-Spec and licensed Apache-2.0.

This is an independent implementation. It is not produced, endorsed or certified
by ADL, and no ADL specification text is reproduced here.

The verb and extension IRIs this library emits are in a Febris-controlled
namespace and are not part of the xAPI specification.
